WEBVTT

00:00.359 --> 00:02.040
Welcome  to  this  beginner's  guide

00:02.040 --> 00:04.319
to  Google  Vids.  Today,  we'll

00:04.319 --> 00:06.279
explore  how  this  browser-based  app

00:06.279 --> 00:08.040
helps  you  transform  ideas  into

00:08.040 --> 00:09.640
professional  video  content.

00:09.961 --> 00:11.561
Google  Vids  is  a  specialized

00:11.561 --> 00:13.320
browser-based  application  designed

00:13.320 --> 00:15.121
for  structured  video  creation  and

00:15.121 --> 00:17.040
editing,  streamlining  your  workflow

00:17.040 --> 00:18.241
directly  in  the  cloud.

00:18.242 --> 00:20.282
Before  you  start,  define  your

00:20.282 --> 00:22.161
project,  clarify  your  target

00:22.161 --> 00:24.362
audience,  the  video's  core  purpose

00:24.362 --> 00:25.722
and  gather  all  your  essential

00:25.722 --> 00:26.762
source  materials.

00:27.083 --> 00:29.603
Use  AI  as  your  copilot.  It  helps

00:29.603 --> 00:31.562
generate  a  structured  storyboard,

00:31.562 --> 00:33.723
organizes  your  scenes  and  suggests

00:33.723 --> 00:35.603
appropriate  stock  media  to  build

00:35.603 --> 00:36.523
your  initial  draft.

00:37.123 --> 00:39.604
Now,  take  the  rains.  Human  lead

00:39.604 --> 00:41.484
editing  is  crucial.  Review  the

00:41.484 --> 00:43.923
draft  to  ensure  factual  accuracy.

00:43.923 --> 00:45.844
Perfect  the  narrative  flow  and

00:45.844 --> 00:47.203
align  the  video  with  your  brand

00:47.203 --> 00:47.604
style.

00:47.885 --> 00:49.764
Finally,  add  and  review  the

00:49.764 --> 00:51.884
English  AI  voice  over  for  natural

00:51.884 --> 00:54.524
pacing.  One  satisfied,  preview  your

00:54.524 --> 00:56.405
project,  collaborate  with  your  team

00:56.405 --> 00:58.605
and  export  your  final  MP4  video.

00:58.965 --> 01:00.846
AI  handles  the  drafting  heavy

01:00.846 --> 01:02.565
lifting,  but  you  maintain  full

01:02.565 --> 01:04.846
creative  control.  Collaborate,

01:04.846 --> 01:06.365
preview,  and  export  your

01:06.365 --> 01:07.966
professional  video  whenever  you  are

01:07.966 --> 01:08.366
ready.
